# /public/build is now tracked on purpose, so the staff UI can be reviewed from a
# checkout without running a build first. The asset filenames are content-hashed,
# so a rebuild that changes the CSS or JS leaves the previous hash behind - prune
# the stale ones with `git rm -r --cached public/build/assets` before re-adding.
